    'I can explain why a business may need finance for short-term needs.',
    'I can explain why a business may need finance for long-term needs.',
    'I can explain why finance may be needed to start up a business.',
    'I can explain why finance may be needed to expand a business.',
    'I can explain how personal savings can be used as an internal source of finance.',
    'I can explain how retained profit can be used as an internal source of finance.',
